# JVM fatal-error / replay dumps from Gradle/KSP crashes
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Markdown files local-only (except README and the published docs/ set).
# NOTE: "!docs/" alone is a no-op — *.md matches at every depth, and negating the
# directory cannot re-include files that themselves match the pattern. The
# per-path negations below are what actually ship.
*.md
!README.md
!docs/**

